SEC stage scheduling is adapted from the architecture and scheduling algorithms
of bevy_ecs v0.20.1 (Bevy Contributors), https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy.
In particular, compiled schedules, cached conflict masks, dependency counters,
ready/running/completed sets, and deferred-work synchronization follow that design.
The implementation is adapted for safe hecs storage and Tokio task ownership;
Bevy's unsafe World access and entity/query implementation are not included.
